# NGUI in templates and components

Package: `@cigna/cigna_dae_ngui_library`.

- Import **`XxxModule`** from `@cigna/cigna_dae_ngui_library/lib/<package>` into standalone component `imports`.
- Prefer **`ngui-*`** over raw Bootstrap/Material/custom markup for buttons, cards, typography, tabs, header chrome.
- Use **`var(--…)` design tokens** for spacing/color — no hardcoded hex or arbitrary px font sizes.
- **`ngui-typography`** for headings and emphasis; body text inside **`ngui-card`** can stay plain when defaults suffice.
- Tables: `ngui-table` + AG Grid for interactive grids; `ngui-simple-table` for static data only.

Deprecated: `progress-bar`, `content-element`, `sidebar`, `date-range-picker`, `x-http`.

Component API: `node_modules/@cigna/cigna_dae_ngui_library/lib/interfaces/<name>.ts`
